WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.180
- Can I tell you this really quick?

00:00:01.180 --> 00:00:02.130
- Yes.

00:00:02.130 --> 00:00:04.890
- It was early 2000's,

00:00:04.890 --> 00:00:07.050
and I had been doing my
plays for a long time

00:00:07.050 --> 00:00:09.610
and I got a chance to do
one here for the first time,

00:00:09.610 --> 00:00:10.790
everybody's saying you
have to do it in L.A.,

00:00:10.790 --> 00:00:11.780
you have to do it in L.A.

00:00:11.780 --> 00:00:14.670
So I do it at the Wilshire Ebell Theater.

00:00:14.670 --> 00:00:16.610
Everybody shows up, all the agents show up

00:00:16.610 --> 00:00:17.720
and it was a big moment for me.

00:00:17.720 --> 00:00:19.040
They had offers for me to do things

00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:20.733
and that'd never happened for me before.

00:00:20.733 --> 00:00:21.566
- [Kelly] Wow.

00:00:21.566 --> 00:00:23.820
- So I'm driving home and I'm in tears.

00:00:23.820 --> 00:00:25.850
I'm so grateful, so thankful to God

00:00:25.850 --> 00:00:27.307
and I hear your song for the first time,

00:00:27.307 --> 00:00:28.220
"A Moment Like This."

00:00:28.220 --> 00:00:29.970
- Oh.
- Yes.

00:00:29.970 --> 00:00:32.280
And that thing tore me
up so I'm trying to drive

00:00:32.280 --> 00:00:34.970
and crying it's a moment like
this I've been waiting for.

00:00:34.970 --> 00:00:36.090
So, thank you.

00:00:36.090 --> 00:00:36.930
- It tore me up to, I cried to.

00:00:36.930 --> 00:00:38.094
- Thank you for that, yeah.

00:00:38.094 --> 00:00:39.040
Thank you for that.

00:00:39.040 --> 00:00:43.700
- Oh my gosh, that's so funny
that you don't know each other

00:00:43.700 --> 00:00:45.500
and then years later
we run into each other.

00:00:45.500 --> 00:00:48.130
That's such a, life is so
beautiful I love that about life.

00:00:48.130 --> 00:00:49.480
You never know what is
going to affect you,

00:00:49.480 --> 00:00:51.730
the domino effect it
will have, it's so cool.

